      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean \"mixed\" is kind of a cop out lol. if you look at the actual manufacturing towns in the rust belt, it feels pretty obviously like a failure for them. all the jobs just moved overseas and the wages tanked. can't you just say that the net effect for the working class was negative?",
